---

Why Kafka?

Without Kafka:

Browser → ASR

Problems:

ASR downtime impacts users

Difficult scaling

No buffering

No fault tolerance


With Kafka:

Browser → Gateway → Kafka → ASR

Benefits:

Reliability

Messages survive pod restarts.

Load Balancing

Multiple ASR workers consume automatically.

Scalability

Add more GPUs later without frontend changes.

Backpressure Handling

Traffic spikes do not crash ASR.


